<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM load factor rises in May.</title>
<headline>KLM load factor rises in May.</headline>
<text>
<p>AMSTERDAM, June 6, Reuter - Provisional traffic and load factor figures from KLM Royal Dutch Airlines</p>
<p>(millions of tonne-kilometres unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>				May '97   May '96  Apr-May 97 Apr-May 96</p>
<p>TOTAL TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic			 783.9     710.3     1,535.1    1,392.7</p>
<p>Capacity		    1,021.3     980.6     1,985.2    1,925.2</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	    76.8	72.4	  77.3	 72.3</p>
<p>PASSENGER TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Passenger kilometres    4,528.6   3,912.2     8,923.0    7,614.0</p>
<p>Seat kilometres	   5,858.9   5,457.9    11,451.9   10,646.7</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	    77.3	71.7	  77.9	 71.5</p>
<p>FREIGHT TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic			 328.1     316.4	 637.8	627.2</p>
<p>Capacity			470.8     477.8	 906.8	942.1</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	    69.7	66.2	  70.3	 66.6</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
